## Project Overview
This project showcases the advanced 3D parametric design and structural kinematics assembly of a heavy-duty industrial Scissor Lifter Elevation System built within SolidWorks. The mechanism is engineered to elevate mechanical payloads vertically via synchronized scissor-arm linkages. 

The assembly demonstrates mastery over complex linkage degrees of freedom (DOF), mechanical joint alignment, structural chassis constraints, and top-down enclosure planning.

